last_updated:           2026-09-17
source_event:           falcosecurity-libs 0.25.4 PR 8977 CI builds 52216 and 49520 fixture/configure timeout, official S3 endpoint probe, and device conan create verification
source_pr:              8977
source_commit:          dc31e8401dd0f42843c0ed9164efeeb6a17b1e11 (PR 8977 current verification baseline)

metrics_success_count:  3
metrics_fail_count:     1
